FlatDecorator and FlatControlLook from Haiku (as in Renku OS's source tree,
github.com/RenkuOS/Source, commit 8cf759ea8e6b, src/add-ons/decorators and
src/add-ons/control_look). MIT licence, Copyright Haiku, Inc.; see the
notices in each file. FlatControlLook is by nhtello (unarix), who first made
both for haiku_darkstyle (github.com/unarix/haiku_darkstyle).

Two changes from those:
- The gradients in both end with a stop at 255. Past the last stop,
  app_server's horizontal gradients draw whatever was in memory, which showed
  as coloured stripes on a left-titled window's tab.
- FlatDecorator's corners are rounded on a composited desktop, when the
  system's headers have RoundedDecorator.h. On other systems it builds without
  this and its corners stay square.

Haiku ships them in its haiku_extras package; Renku's repositories don't
offer that, so Reactionary builds them for the Flat themes.
